        <span class="avatar" style="background-image:url('/images/about.jpg')"></span>
        <span>By Gee</span>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>Sep 21, 2026</span>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>6 min read</span>
      </div>

